{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"有片｜神舟二十四號三名航天員出征儀式\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-25-06-08-45SAOFsCuU.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】神舟二十四號預期今早8時許發射升空，乘組由指令長由湯洪波擔任，帶同航天員武毅及阿里早上5時許里一同現身圓夢園廣場，向在場的民眾揮手，再逐一登上專車，在車隊的護送下，前往發射場。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T23:04:22.157880+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":96,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T22:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T22:57:51.175794+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T22:57:51.175794+00:00","content_hash":"9eecfb58b8c2a6a0cafda7004e5d8b90eee657f84b44079ca1d1787a35675873","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}